                                    <!-- Component | Band_header -->


    
                
                                                
  <div class="rh-band-header--component" data-rh-align=left        ><h2 class="rh-band-header-subsection-headline" id="rh-bh5y1">Ready to move from patchwork to platform?</h2>
</div>
                                    <!-- Component | Generic -->


    <div class="rh-generic--component"
                 data-rh-align="left"    >
        <p>You already know the benefits of upstream Ansible tools. But if your organization is ready to take automation to the next level, it's time to consider Red Hat Ansible Automation Platform. It delivers more capabilities-like event-driven automation and generative AI-that reduce manual effort and increase efficiency, as well as enhanced security and end-to-end technical support.</p>
    </div>
