  <div class="rh-band-header--component" data-rh-align=left        ><h2 class="rh-band-header-subsection-headline" id="rh-pjtg7">Automation adoption</h2>
</div>
                                    <!-- Component | Generic -->


    <div class="rh-generic--component"
                 data-rh-align="left"    >
        <div><p>Expanding automation in your organization requires expertise in both technology and culture. Red Hat excels in creating and supporting successful communities, and we can help you build yours.</p></div>
    </div>
